WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.692 --> 00:00:10.108
In this walkthrough, we change the visible navigation label from Papers to For authors.

2
00:00:10.108 --> 00:00:12.416
This matters because navigation labels are edited in the widget configuration, not directly on the public website. The label and the linked page are separate things.

3
00:00:12.416 --> 00:00:14.266
Open the page editor for the page that contains the navigation used on the site.

4
00:00:14.266 --> 00:00:16.780
Expand the Navigation slot to reveal the navigation widget row.

5
00:00:16.780 --> 00:00:17.457
Find the Navigation widget that controls the public menu.

6
00:00:17.457 --> 00:00:20.873
Click the settings icon on the Navigation widget row.

7
00:00:20.873 --> 00:00:25.745
Change the visible menu label from Papers to For authors.

8
00:00:25.745 --> 00:00:31.129
Check that the link still points to the intended author information page.

9
00:00:31.129 --> 00:00:33.453
After this walkthrough, you should know where to open the navigation widget, which menu item to edit, and what to check before saving.
